-- Kling Image 4.0 (text to image and with input images, one provider
-- endpoint): per size (2K, 4K, 8K; no 1K), per input item on the edit id (a
-- reference image or a named subject, 1 to 10), and for a set of 2 to 10
-- images (`:x<C>`) that many times one picture's row. The bare ids are the
-- default: 2K, one picture, and on the edit id its one input item.
--
-- Values MUST match STATIC_CREDIT_COSTS in backend/src/ee/billing/credits.ts
-- (generated by kling-image-4-pricing.ts) and the `pricing` rows on each
-- MODEL_CATALOG entry.
--
-- Per CLAUDE.md Provider Enum Sync step 9: ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING (preserves
-- admin overrides).

BEGIN;

ON CONFLICT (model_identifier) DO NOTHING;

COMMIT;
